      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I fully agree. A lot of worlds of mine have an issue where Low is too low and things pop in too early. Meanwhile High graphics settings show you far too much and create more lag then needed. It's very difficult to optimize LOD's to fit in a happy medium between VRLow and VRHigh, and can be nearly impossible depending on what you're trying to do.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
