      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I 100% agree. In addition, world creators should be able to change shadow distance/cascades, as currently these changes are not reflected in the uploaded world if you change project settings. Shadow settings (except maybe shadow resolution) should also be independent of the client quality settings.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
