  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-04-08T12:44:35.803Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As it stands right now, you can optimize LOD distances for VRHigh and have stuff disappear too soon at VRLow and DesktopLow (see: the Great Pug, where most objects disappear a few meters in front of you on VRLow) or optimize for VRLow and have LOD distances that are unhelpful for performance on VRHigh.\nThis presents a problem for world creators trying to optimize for specific viewing distances. I'm not sure what the solution is here but it's not what we have right now. VRChat has also been sorely lacking granular graphics options for far too long and it has an impact on both users and world creators.",
